a property="og:description" content="Confirm the AION 2 release date and current Steam launch status, browse the class roster, compare Founder&#x27;s Pack tiers, and find guides to prepare for US play."/><meta property="og:url" content="https://aion-two.wiki"/><meta property="og:site_name" content="AION 2 Wiki"/><meta property="og:locale" content="en_US"/><meta property="og:type" content="article"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="AION 2 release date, classes, Founder&#x27;s Packs hub"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Confirm the AION 2 release date and current Steam launch status, browse the class roster, compare Founder&#x27;s Pack tiers, and find guides to prepare for US play."/><link rel="shortcut icon" href="/icon.svg"/><link rel="icon" href="/icon.svg"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js" noModule=""></script></head><body><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class="site-theme theme-dark density-comfortable background-gradient motif-lines motif-low" style="--page-bg:#0B1024;--surface-1:#141A33;--surface-2:#1C2243;--surface-3:#252C55;--surface-inverse:#F1ECDB;--text-primary:#EDE8D5;--text-muted:#A6AEC8;--text-inverse:#0B1024;--text-on-accent-primary:#0B1024;--text-link:#E2C46F;--focus-ring:#F0D27A;--line:#2C3458;--line-strong:#3D4570;--accent-primary:#3F5BD9;--accent-secondary:#8A5BD6;--accent-bright:#E2C46F;--status-confirmed:#5DB67A;--status-caution:#D89E40;--status-unknown:#8A93A6;--font-heading:Cinzel, Marcellus, &#x27;EB Garamond&#x27;, &#x27;Times New Roman&#x27;, serif;--font-body:Inter, &#x27;IBM Plex Sans&#x27;, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, system-ui, sans-serif;--heading-weight:700;--radius:10px;--border-width:1px;--shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(5, 8, 22, 0.55);--hover-lift:2px;--background-overlay:0.72;--background-position:center top;--background-image:none" data-locale="en-US"><header class="site-header"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">A2W</span><span>AION 2 Wiki</span></a><nav class="primary-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation"><a href="/release-date">Release Date</a><a href="/global-release">Global Release</a><a href="/founders-packs">Founder&#x27;s Packs</a><a href="/preorder-bonus">Preorder Bonus</a><a href="/system-requirements">System Requirements</a><a href="/classes">Classes</a><a href="/guides">Guides</a><a href="/guides/abyss-factions">Abyss Factions</a></nav><div class="site-search" data-locale="en-US"><button type="button" class="search-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="site-search-panel">Search</button></div></header><main lang="en-US"><article class="home-page" data-variant="media-hero"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebSite","name":"AION 2 Wiki","url":"https://aion-two.wiki","description":"AION 2 Wiki is an unofficial pre-launch reference hub for US English search users: release date status, Founder's Pack tiers, classes, system requirements, guides hub, and Abyss faction PvP context for the AION 2 Steam launch."}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"CollectionPage","name":"AION 2 release date, classes, Founder's Packs hub","url":"https://aion-two.wiki","description":"Pre-launch reference hub for AION 2 (Steam AppID 3393110): release date status, Founder's Pack tiers, classes, system requirements, guides hub, and Abyss faction PvP context for US English search users."}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is AION 2?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"AION 2 is the sequel MMORPG from developer and publisher NCWest, releasing on Steam (AppID 3393110) on October 5, 2026 with English as the primary supported locale. The game continues the AION franchise with class-based combat, open-world PvP, and the contested Abyss faction war."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"When is the AION 2 release date?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The AION 2 release date is October 5, 2026 on Steam, confirmed by the Steam store page and SteamDB listing for AppID 3393110. No pre-launch beta unlock times or head-start windows have been announced."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which AION 2 Founder's Pack tier should US players buy?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Pick Standard ($24.99) if you only want the 5-day Advance Access head start and the base cosmetic bundle. Pick Deluxe ($49.99) for the Ascended Daeva armor and the Eternal Sun weapon. Pick Ultimate ($99.99) for the full cosmetic set (Daeva's Styling Chest, Moonlit Aria armor, Black Dragon pet, Blazing Sun wings). The 5-day Advance Access head start is the same on every tier."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How many AION 2 classes are confirmed?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Eight AION 2 classes are confirmed for launch: assassin, gladiator, cleric, templar, chanter, ranger, sorcerer, and spiritmaster. They group into four archetypes: Warrior (Gladiator, Templar), Scout (Assassin, Ranger), Mage (Sorcerer, Spiritmaster), Priest (Cleric, Chanter). Per-class skill trees and gender-lock status require dated media."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is AION 2 launching globally on Steam?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. The AION 2 global release date of October 5, 2026 is published on the Steam store page for AppID 3393110 and covers all Steam regions worldwide. Per-console storefront availability beyond Steam is not announced."}}]}</script><header class="page-hero home-hero" data-variant="media-hero"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Pre-launch reference</p><h1>AION 2 release date, classes, Founder&#x27;s Packs hub</h1><p>AION 2 release date, classes, Founder&#x27;s Packs, and Abyss faction PvP context for US launch players.</p><p class="page-review"><span>Last reviewed<!-- -->:</span> <time dateTime="2026-09-20">2026-09-20</time></p><div class="cta-row"><a class="btn" href="/release-date">Release date</a><a class="btn" href="/classes">Browse classes</a><a class="btn" href="/founders-packs">Founder&#x27;s Packs</a></div></div></header><section class="home-summary"><p class="quick-answer">Based on the Steam store page and SteamDB listing for AppID 3393110, the AION 2 release date is Oct 5, 2026. The Steam launch is published by NCWest and confirmed across official store and publisher sources. Founder&#x27;s Pack tiers, the class roster, and English-language UI support are also confirmed on the Steam store page. Beta unlock times, Steam Deck verification, mobile cross-play, and review embargo status were not announced.</p><dl class="key-facts"><div class="key-fact"><dt>Release date</dt><dd>October 5, 2026 (Steam AppID 3393110)</dd></div><div class="key-fact"><dt>Publisher</dt><dd>NCWest</dd></div><div class="key-fact"><dt>Platform</dt><dd>Steam (Windows 10 64-bit minimum)</dd></div><div class="key-fact"><dt>Language</dt><dd>English (primary supported locale)</dd></div><div class="key-fact"><dt>Last verified</dt><dd>2026-09-20</dd></div></dl></section><div class="guide-modules"><section id="release-window" class="content-module"><h2>Launch &amp; Status</h2><div class="entity-grid"><a class="entity-card" href="/release-date"><h3>Release date status</h3><p>Confirm the AION 2 release date and current Steam launch stage.</p></a><a class="entity-card" href="/global-release"><h3>Global release scope</h3><p>Understand the worldwide launch scope, region ordering, and Korean franchise context.</p></a><a class="entity-card" href="/founders-packs"><h3>Founder&#x27;s Packs</h3><p>Compare Standard ($24.99), Deluxe ($49.99), and Ultimate ($99.99) tiers with named cosmetics and the 5-day Advance Access head start.</p></a><a class="entity-card" href="/preorder-bonus"><h3>Preorder bonus</h3><p>Digital entitlements and Founder&#x27;s Pack overlap explained before launch.</p></a><a class="entity-card" href="/system-requirements"><h3>System requirements</h3><p>PC minimum specs and Steam Deck / mobile cross-play status as of the research date.</p></a></div></section><section id="classes-and-guides" class="content-module"><h2>Classes &amp; Guides</h2><div class="entity-grid"><a class="entity-card" href="/classes"><h3>Classes hub</h3><p>Browse the eight launch AION 2 classes with role archetypes, per-class weapons, and a starter-class pick framework.</p></a><a class="entity-card" href="/guides"><h3>Guides hub</h3><p>Beginner, progression, and endgame guides for AION 2 grouped by stage.</p></a><a class="entity-card" href="/guides/leveling"><h3>Leveling guide</h3><p>Quest and dungeon priority with the level 45 milestone that opens the Abyss.</p></a><a class="entity-card" href="/guides/dungeons-beginner"><h3>Beginner dungeons</h3><p>First instanced group content with mechanics, groups, and rewards.</p></a><a class="entity-card" href="/guides/pvp-basics"><h3>PvP basics</h3><p>Open-world PvP, gear progression, and class suitability in the Abyss setting.</p></a><a class="entity-card" href="/guides/abyss-factions"><h3>Abyss factions</h3><p>Elyos vs Asmodians conflict, sieges, and endgame progression.</p></a><a class="entity-card" href="/world-zones"><h3>World zones</h3><p>Starting zones, level-gated regions, and flight mechanics across the world map.</p></a></div></section><aside id="safety-notes" class="status-callout" data-tone="caution" aria-labelledby="safety-notes-title"><h2 id="safety-notes-title">What is not confirmed as of 2026-09-20</h2><p>Pre-launch beta unlock times, head-start windows, Steam Deck verification status, mobile cross-play support, and review embargoes have not been announced by NCWest. The level 45 milestone that opens the Abyss is a community-discussed reference point, not an officially confirmed cap. Per-class skill trees, gender-lock status, and tier rankings also require dated media or beta-confirmed sources.</p></aside></div><section class="recent-updates" aria-labelledby="recent-updates-heading"><h2 id="recent-updates-heading">Recent updates</h2><div class="recent-updates-grid"><a class="recent-update-card" href="/classes"><strong>AION 2 classes: roster, roles, and selection guide</strong><span>The eight launch AION 2 classes with role archetypes, named weapons, skill categories, and a starter-class pick framework as of 2026-09-22.</span><time dateTime="2026-09-20">Last reviewed<!-- -->: <!-- -->2026-09-20</time></a><a class="recent-update-card" href="/founders-packs"><strong>AION 2 founders packs: tiers, prices, early access</strong><span>Comparison of the three confirmed AION 2 Founder&#x27;s Packs tiers (Standard $24.99, Deluxe $49.99, Ultimate $99.99) with named cosmetics, early-access days, the July 22 - October 4 sale window, and the one-pack-per-account rule, all dated to 2026-09-22.</span><time dateTime="2026-09-20">Last reviewed<!-- -->: <!-- -->2026-09-20</time></a><a class="recent-update-card" href="/global-release"><strong>AION 2 global release date, regions, launch scope</strong><span>The AION 2 global release date of October 5, 2026, how Steam distributes the game worldwide, and what US players should expect from regional storefront scope.</span><time dateTime="2026-09-20">Last reviewed<!-- -->: <!-- -->2026-09-20</time></a><a class="recent-update-card" href="/guides"><strong>AION 2 guides</strong><span>Index of beginner, progression, and endgame guides for AION 2 grouped by stage, anchored in the launch date and Abyss unlock milestone.</span><time dateTime="2026-09-20">Last reviewed<!-- -->: <!-- -->2026-09-20</time></a><a class="recent-update-card" href="/guides/abyss-factions"><strong>AION 2 Abyss factions: Elyos, Asmodians, and sieges</strong><span>AION 2 Abyss factions, the Elyos vs Asmodians conflict, sieges and fortresses, and endgame progression.</span><time dateTime="2026-09-20">Last reviewed<!-- -->: <!-- -->2026-09-20</time></a></div></section><section class="related-links" aria-labelledby="related-heading"><h2 id="related-heading">Related Pages</h2><div class="related-grid"><a class="related-card" href="/release-date"><strong>AION 2 release date: launch status and Steam page</strong><span>The AION 2 release date of October 5, 2026, the current Steam launch stage, and how to verify status before launch.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="/classes"><strong>AION 2 classes: roster, roles, and selection guide</strong><span>The eight launch AION 2 classes with role archetypes, named weapons, skill categories, and a starter-class pick framework as of 2026-09-22.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="/founders-packs"><strong>AION 2 founders packs: tiers, prices, early access</strong><span>Comparison of the three confirmed AION 2 Founder&#x27;s Packs tiers (Standard $24.99, Deluxe $49.99, Ultimate $99.99) with named cosmetics, early-access days, the July 22 - October 4 sale window, and the one-pack-per-account rule, all dated to 2026-09-22.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="/system-requirements"><strong>AION 2 system requirements</strong><span>AION 2 PC minimum specification (confirmed on the Steam store page), Steam Deck and mobile cross-play status, and the pre-launch preparation checklist.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="/preorder-bonus"><strong>AION 2 preorder bonus</strong><span>Digital preorder entitlements for AION 2 on Steam, Founder&#x27;s Pack overlap rules, and the list of items that are not announced as of 2026-09-20.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="/guides"><strong>AION 2 guides</strong><span>Index of beginner, progression, and endgame guides for AION 2 grouped by stage, anchored in the launch date and Abyss unlock milestone.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="/global-release"><strong>AION 2 global release date, regions, launch scope</strong><span>The AION 2 global release date of October 5, 2026, how Steam distributes the game worldwide, and what US players should expect from regional storefront scope.</span></a></div></section><section class="faq-block" aria-labelledby="faq-heading"><h2 id="faq-heading">FAQ</h2><div class="faq-list"><details class="faq-item"><summary>What is AION 2?</summary><p>AION 2 is the sequel MMORPG from developer and publisher NCWest, releasing on Steam (AppID 3393110) on October 5, 2026 with English as the primary supported locale. The game continues the AION franchise with class-based combat, open-world PvP, and the contested Abyss faction war.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>When is the AION 2 release date?</summary><p>The AION 2 release date is October 5, 2026 on Steam, confirmed by the Steam store page and SteamDB listing for AppID 3393110. No pre-launch beta unlock times or head-start windows have been announced.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>Which AION 2 Founder&#x27;s Pack tier should US players buy?</summary><p>Pick Standard ($24.99) if you only want the 5-day Advance Access head start and the base cosmetic bundle. Pick Deluxe ($49.99) for the Ascended Daeva armor and the Eternal Sun weapon. Pick Ultimate ($99.99) for the full cosmetic set (Daeva&#x27;s Styling Chest, Moonlit Aria armor, Black Dragon pet, Blazing Sun wings). The 5-day Advance Access head start is the same on every tier.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>How many AION 2 classes are confirmed?</summary><p>Eight AION 2 classes are confirmed for launch: assassin, gladiator, cleric, templar, chanter, ranger, sorcerer, and spiritmaster. They group into four archetypes: Warrior (Gladiator, Templar), Scout (Assassin, Ranger), Mage (Sorcerer, Spiritmaster), Priest (Cleric, Chanter). Per-class skill trees and gender-lock status require dated media.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>Is AION 2 launching globally on Steam?</summary><p>Yes. The AION 2 global release date of October 5, 2026 is published on the Steam store page for AppID 3393110 and covers all Steam regions worldwide. Per-console storefront availability beyond Steam is not announced.</p></details></div></section></article></main><footer class="site-footer"><p>AION 2 Wiki is an unofficial fan reference built from the AION 2 Steam store page (AppID 3393110), SteamDB metadata, the NCWest and PlayNC publisher portals, and r/aion community discussion. Current-game facts are dated to research date 2026-09-20; any item that has not been confirmed in official or dated media is written as a dated not-confirmed status note. The original 2009 AION is referenced only as legacy clarification; AION 2 systems are evolved versions and not directly inherited.</p><nav aria-label="Footer navigation"><a href="/about">About</a><a href="/contact">Contact</a><a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy</a><a href="/terms">Terms</a><a class="sponsored-link" href="https://www.profitableratecpmnetwork.com/tjwhs0wh7?key=b1623b0c7fff98e6b14c2f23c83c93ab" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener noreferrer" data-ad-provider="adsterra" data-ad-unit="smartlink">Sponsored Link</a></nav></footer></div><!--$--><!--/$--><script src="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-4e7b8d84dabaec96.js" id="_R_" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[9766,[],\"\"]\n3:I[8924,[],\"\"]\n4:I[2619,[\"619\",\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\",\"356\",\"static/chunks/356-ba125e9f1b9f7c55.js\",\"719\",\"static/chunks/719-507d47ffd59af508.js\",\"974\",\"static/chunks/app/page-92fb55f21cb2cd59.js\"],\"\"]\n5:I[8519,[\"619\",\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\",\"356\",\"static/chunks/356-ba125e9f1b9f7c55.js\",\"719\",\"static/chunks/719-507d47ffd59af508.js\",\"974\",\"static/chunks/app/page-92fb55f21cb2cd59.js\"],\"SearchDialog\"]\na:I[7150,[],\"\"]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/css/6ef03796699e834e.css\",\"style\"]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"0:{\"P\":null,\"b\":\"HpcDNBub2ZmDhlT5rMhSz\",\"p\":\"\",\"c\":[\"\",\"\"],\"i\":false,\"f\":[[[\"\",{\"children\":[\"__PAGE__\",{}]},