\",null,{\"children\":\"When is the AION 2 release date?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The AION 2 release date is October 5, 2026 on Steam, confirmed by the Steam store page and SteamDB listing for AppID 3393110. No pre-launch beta unlock times or head-start windows have been announced.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"which-founders-pack-tier\",{\"className\":\"faq-item\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"Which AION 2 Founder's Pack tier should US players buy?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Pick Standard ($24.99) if you only want the 5-day Advance Access head start and the base cosmetic bundle. Pick Deluxe ($49.99) for the Ascended Daeva armor and the Eternal Sun weapon. Pick Ultimate ($99.99) for the full cosmetic set (Daeva's Styling Chest, Moonlit Aria armor, Black Dragon pet, Blazing Sun wings). The 5-day Advance Access head start is the same on every tier.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"how-many-aion-2-classes\",{\"className\":\"faq-item\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"How many AION 2 classes are confirmed?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Eight AION 2 classes are confirmed for launch: assassin, gladiator, cleric, templar, chanter, ranger, sorcerer, and spiritmaster. They group into four archetypes: Warrior (Gladiator, Templar), Scout (Assassin, Ranger), Mage (Sorcerer, Spiritmaster), Priest (Cleric, Chanter). Per-class skill trees and gender-lock status require dated media.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"is-aion-2-global-on-steam\",{\"className\":\"faq-item\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"Is AION 2 launching globally on Steam?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Yes. The AION 2 global release date of October 5, 2026 is published on the Steam store page for AppID 3393110 and covers all Steam regions worldwide. Per-console storefront availability beyond Steam is not announced.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"15:[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"site-footer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"AION 2 Wiki is an unofficial fan reference built from the AION 2 Steam store page (AppID 3393110), SteamDB metadata, the NCWest and PlayNC publisher portals, and r/aion community discussion. Current-game facts are dated to research date 2026-09-20; any item that has not been confirmed in official or dated media is written as a dated not-confirmed status note. The original 2009 AION is referenced only as legacy clarification; AION 2 systems are evolved versions and not directly inherited.\"}],[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Footer navigation\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"$L4\",\"/about\",{\"href\":\"/about\",\"children\":\"About\"}],[\"$\",\"$L4\",\"/contact\",{\"href\":\"/contact\",\"children\":\"Contact\"}],[\"$\",\"$L4\",\"/privacy-policy\",{\"href\":\"/privacy-policy\",\"children\":\"Privacy\"}],[\"$\",\"$L4\",\"/terms\",{\"href\":\"/terms\",\"children\":\"Terms\"}]],[\"$\",\"$Lb\",null,{}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"16:[\"$\",\"$L1d\",null,{\"children\":[\"$L1e\",[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{\"promise\":\"$@20\"}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"18:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1e:null\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"21:I[622,[],\"IconMark\"]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"20:{\"metadata\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"AION 2 release date, classes, Founder's Packs hub\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Confirm the AION 2 release date and current Steam launch status, browse the class roster, compare Founder's Pack tiers, and find guides to prepare for US play.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"manifest\",\"href\":\"/manifest.webmanifest\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"3\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://aion-two.wiki\"}]